## Lakebase triggered/continuous sync from _data / complete _slots
================================================================================

Context: Task 5 of the incremental triple materialization plan. The Lakeflow
synced table moves off the R2RML gateway VIEW onto the `_data` copy (or a
`_slots` table that holds every triple) and syncs on a schedule derived from
the domain's materialization mode, capped by the workspace
`graph_engine_config.lakebase.sync_table_mode`. The scheduled-build mirror
syncs the same source, and a registration whose source or schedule changed is
deleted and recreated (a synced table's definition cannot change in place).

