1. src/back/core/graphdb/lakebase/LakebaseBase.py
   `normalize_sync_table_mode` accepts `snapshot`, `triggered`, `continuous`
   (new public `SYNC_TABLE_MODES`, least to most frequent); unknown strings
   still raise `ValueError`. Docstrings describe the value as a cap. New
